# Reference only. NOTHING reads a .env file at runtime — the API takes
# configuration from real environment variables and every one has a working
# default (services/api/prahari_api/config.py). `docker compose up` with no
# variables set runs the API in mock mode against the bundled fixture.
#
# The frontend has NO environment variables: it calls the fixed relative path
# /api/v1 and the same origin (nginx, or the Vite dev proxy) forwards it.
#
# Set any of the below only to override a default.

# --- data source ---------------------------------------------------------------
# mock (default) = serve contracts/fixtures, no network, no propagation.
# live           = fetch CelesTrak, run SGP4, screen for real.
# Setting DATABASE_URL implies live regardless of this value.
# PRAHARI_DATA_SOURCE=mock

# JSON array of screened events loaded and schema-checked at startup in mock
# mode. Default: contracts/fixtures/conjunctions.real.json.
# PRAHARI_EVENTS_PATH=contracts/fixtures/conjunctions.real.json

# --- database (optional) -----------------------------------------------------
# Unset -> in-memory JSON fixture, no Postgres container needed.
# Set it (e.g. via `make demo-storage`) to read from Postgres instead.
# DATABASE_URL=postgresql+asyncpg://prahari:prahari@db:5432/prahari
# POSTGRES_USER=prahari
# POSTGRES_PASSWORD=prahari
# POSTGRES_DB=prahari

# --- geometry cache (optional) ---------------------------------------------------
# Unset -> cache off, /conjunctions/{id}/geometry computed directly each time.
# Set it (live mode only) to memoise those responses in Redis.
# REDIS_URL=redis://redis:6379/0
# CONJUNCTION_STREAM_CHANNEL=prahari:conjunction_events

# --- worker (optional) ---------------------------------------------------------
# CELERY_BROKER_URL=redis://redis:6379/1
# CELERY_RESULT_BACKEND=redis://redis:6379/2

# --- api ---------------------------------------------------------------------
# API_HOST=0.0.0.0
# API_PORT=8000
# Comma-separated. Default: http://localhost:5173,http://localhost:8080
# (only matters for cross-origin local dev; the shipped deployment is same-origin).
# API_CORS_ORIGINS=http://localhost:5173,http://localhost:8080

# --- ingest / screening ------------------------------------------------------
# CELESTRAK_GP_URL=https://celestrak.org/NORAD/elements/gp.php?GROUP=active&FORMAT=tle
# SCREENING_WINDOW_HOURS=72
# SCREENING_INTERVAL_HOURS=6
# COARSE_FILTER_THRESHOLD_KM=25
# COMBINED_RADIUS_MARGIN_M=0
